name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-preassessment-q10_2026'

question 'You are designing a feature where tapping a heart icon either likes or unlikes a post. You decide to sketch a flowchart before writing any JavaScript. Why?'

right 'The flowchart is a behavioral spec — it shows what should happen for every user action before any code is written.'
wrong 'Flowcharts are required by the browser before code can run.'
wrong 'Flowcharts replace the need for code entirely.'
wrong 'Flowcharts make the app load faster.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 5
MARKDOWN
